+
+### Checklist migrasi
+- [ ] Tambahkan `dividerTheme` di `app_theme.dart`
+- [ ] Verifikasi `transaction_detail_screen.dart` (3×), `cart_drawer.dart`,
+      `customer_picker_sheet.dart`, `variant_selection_modal.dart` ikut
+      berubah otomatis jadi `AppColors.border`
+
